<title>BELGIUM: Belgium raises liquidity slightly at money tender.</title>
<headline>Belgium raises liquidity slightly at money tender.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1996-10-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Belgian National Bank raised liquidity slightly at its fixed-rate tender for seven-day advances. Details:-</p>
<p>    Value date 30/10	  expiry on 06/11</p>
<p>    Amount allotted	   12.525 bln bfr (11.750 bln bfr*)</p>
<p>    Interest rate	     3.00 pct (3.00 pct**)</p>
<p>    Total amount of bids    12.525 bln bfr</p>
<p>    Percentage of bids accepted  100</p>
<p>* amount draining from the money market on Oct 30</p>
<p>** interest rate at previous tender on Oct 21</p>
<p>-- Brussels Newsroom +32 2 287 6810, Fax +32 2 230 7710</p>
